%% 07 Citation snapshot và source viewer
sequenceDiagram
  participant RAG as Python RAG Service
  participant Node as NodeJS Core
  participant DB as MySQL
  participant Client as Web hoặc Mobile
  participant Store as Local File Storage

  RAG-->>Node: Structured answer với source fragments
  Node->>DB: Resolve vector_node_id tới chunk/document READY + VISIBLE
  Node->>DB: Persist ordered immutable citation snapshots trong completion transaction
  Note over Node,DB: Không parse bracket marker; snapshot vẫn tồn tại sau hide/delete

  Client->>Node: Request citation metadata bằng user JWT
  Node->>DB: Join citation, assistant message và session
  alt Không phải session owner
    Node-->>Client: 404
  else Được phép
    Node-->>Client: sourceText + trustworthy page nếu có + nullable locator + dynamic URLs
    alt previewUrl có giá trị
      Client->>Node: Fetch canonical preview bằng Bearer
      Node->>Store: Stream uploaded PDF hoặc persistent DOCX-derived PDF
      Store-->>Client: PDF inline
    end
    alt originalFileUrl có giá trị
      Note over Client,Node: PDF/DOCX original chỉ uploader Teacher/Admin; TXT có Library fallback
      Client->>Node: Fetch original bằng Bearer
      Node->>Store: Stream attachment nếu current authorization/state còn hợp lệ
    end
  end

  Note over RAG,Client: sourceText luôn dùng được; physical-page navigation chỉ khi page identity đáng tin
  Note over RAG,Client: Geometry nullable/OPTIONAL-LATER và không sửa page uncertainty
